s1-2-p2 : Block
s1-2-p2 = prose (cons "Represented terms form an inductive type `Code`, with an interpretation `eval-g` mapping codes to the terms they denote. The checker is itself a term: it analyzes the evaluator's values through a structured observation `%view`, checks their types and conversion, and returns its judgment. The specializer operates on these representations by normalization and equality-directed rewriting. Its results are admitted through the same checking relation as ordinary definitions. The initial code representation and checker are part of the bootstrap; a checked, context-and-type-indexed code family is a separate construction, developed in §6.1. Neither construction assumes unrestricted quotation of arbitrary semantic values." nil)
